<tr><td>Effort and calorie burn</td><td>Light to moderate, you control it</td><td>Very light in passive mode, higher if you pedal</td></tr>
<tr><td>Noise</td><td>Quietest option, no motor</td><td>Low motor hum, louder at high speeds</td></tr>
